chunks.text:
[Cold / Title]
{very quiet and sparse: low sustained drone, ticking clock}
{ends with a reverse swell into the next downbeat}
{after 2.5 s: opens on a massive low brass braam and a sub boom impact}
{restrained, building tension: low sustained drone}

[Dawn]
{restrained, building tension: low sustained drone, ticking clock, pulsing staccato strings, warm string pad, sparse taiko hits}
{ends with a rising riser into the next downbeat}

[Noon]
{opens on a massive low brass braam and a sub boom impact}
{intense: driving sixteenth-note string ostinato, bright and wide, pounding taiko ensemble, tom fills, hybrid trailer percussion, rimshot accents}

[Golden / Slowmo]
{opens on a massive low brass braam}
{full power climax: driving sixteenth-note string ostinato, bright and wide, pounding taiko ensemble, fast hi-hat sixteenths, tom fills, rimshot accents, warm string pad}
{after 2.5 s: opens on a sub boom impact}
{restrained, building tension: heartbeat pulse, low sustained drone}
{ends with a rising riser into the next downbeat}

[Night]
{opens on a massive low brass braam and a sub boom impact}
{full power climax: pounding taiko ensemble, tom fills, fast hi-hat sixteenths, rimshot accents, driving sixteenth-note string ostinato, bright and wide, low sustained drone}
{ends with a reverse swell into the next downbeat}

[End]
{opens on a massive low brass braam and a sub boom impact}
{intense: low sustained drone, ticking clock}
{ends on a hard stop into silence}
